06-11 19:27<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2FllzFgRCF_eMn1oAQE27PaQ\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/llzFgRCF_eMn1oAQE27PaQ</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<center><img alt=\"官方消息108.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e8/p2qk6c60ntwhlb6j6qahaua714dbler.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF108.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"90\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/e8/p2qk6c60ntwhlb6j6qahaua714dbler.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"120\" /><br /><br />\n<p><font color=\"#D2691E\">----------------------------------------&#160;<img alt=\"官方消息109.gif\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/eb/4due6dh292oc2yec578vkoocx7heuch.gif/40px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF109.gif\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"28\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/eb/4due6dh292oc2yec578vkoocx7heuch.gif/60px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF109.gif 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/eb/4due6dh292oc2yec578vkoocx7heuch.gif/80px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF109.gif 2x\" data-file-width=\"500\" data-file-height=\"348\" />&#160;----------------------------------------</font>\n</p>\n</center><br />\n<p><font style=\"color:#A0522D\">团长们吼啊！<br />\n这里是铃兰之剑前线情报员小场记(≖ᴗ≖)✧<br />\n铃兰之剑X核聚变2023广州站已经完满落幕！</font>\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<center><img alt=\"官方消息124.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/ba/oit6x496035jc322d7y6ievtbru5hap.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF124.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"373\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/ba/oit6x496035jc322d7y6ievtbru5hap.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF124.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/ba/oit6x496035jc322d7y6ievtbru5hap.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"720\" />\n<font style=\"color:#A0522D\">✦</font></center>\n<p><font style=\"color:#A0522D\">今天小场记在现场捕捉到了UP主@lolo今天玩什么和@萌萌哒老陈。</font>\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<center><img alt=\"官方消息125.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/02/3313gh25swo0fmpue3kt0y387ea1731.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF125.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"373\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/02/3313gh25swo0fmpue3kt0y387ea1731.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF125.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/02/3313gh25swo0fmpue3kt0y387ea1731.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"720\" /><br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息126.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/4f/hyuk2228x7fml0gse3vr9svnc9uwmy4.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF126.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"373\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/4f/hyuk2228x7fml0gse3vr9svnc9uwmy4.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF126.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/4f/hyuk2228x7fml0gse3vr9svnc9uwmy4.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"720\" /></center>\n<p><br /><br />\n<font style=\"color:#A0522D\">感谢团长们的热情参与！感谢每一位到现场与我们交流谈论的团长。我们将不负期待，砥砺前行！</font>\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><font color=\"#D2691E\">----------------------------------------&#160;<img alt=\"官方消息109.gif\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/eb/4due6dh292oc2yec578vkoocx7heuch.gif/40px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF109.gif\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"28\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/eb/4due6dh292oc2yec578vkoocx7heuch.gif/60px-%E5%AE%98